WEBVTT

00:01:38.290 --> 00:01:41.150
Kyoko, you're forgetting
what's most important.

00:01:41.520 --> 00:01:43.850
What is most important?

00:01:44.320 --> 00:01:45.990
How I feel about you.

00:01:47.660 --> 00:01:48.380
I love you.

00:01:49.210 --> 00:01:50.460
I love you, Kyoko.

00:01:51.660 --> 00:01:54.350
From the moment I met you...

00:01:55.380 --> 00:01:57.210
now, and forever.

00:02:05.410 --> 00:02:06.880
Come on, Soichiro.

00:02:24.200 --> 00:02:26.040
Don't get depressed.

00:02:26.100 --> 00:02:27.940
We'll have a consolation
party for you.

00:02:28.380 --> 00:02:30.040
Why are you saying that?!

00:02:33.380 --> 00:02:34.730
G-Good morning.

00:02:35.280 --> 00:02:37.290
G-Good morning.

00:02:45.160 --> 00:02:46.200
It's today, isn't it,

00:02:46.320 --> 00:02:48.320
that you'll find out
the result of your exams?

00:02:48.700 --> 00:02:49.250
Yes.

00:02:49.570 --> 00:02:51.190
Please let me know.

00:02:51.320 --> 00:02:54.190
O-Of course.
I'm on my way.

00:02:56.360 --> 00:02:56.910
Yes.

00:02:59.070 --> 00:03:02.660
Are you still bothered
about that thing with Akemi?

00:03:04.140 --> 00:03:05.730
N-No, not really.

00:03:09.820 --> 00:03:12.480
Can't believe it.
I have to repeat a year.

00:03:13.060 --> 00:03:15.450
You can still take the
makeup exam. Don't worry.

00:03:15.510 --> 00:03:17.570
It's easy for you to say.

00:03:17.760 --> 00:03:20.010
Just when I got
a job offer, too..

00:03:26.600 --> 00:03:30.390
"Sorry! Don't Cry, Godai!
There's Always Next Year!"

00:03:30.910 --> 00:03:32.700
How's that?

00:03:34.040 --> 00:03:36.630
We don't know
that he's failed.

00:03:37.010 --> 00:03:39.470
But we all have
that feeling, you know..

00:03:39.780 --> 00:03:41.470
well

00:04:05.100 --> 00:04:07.470
I wonder if that was Godai?

00:04:20.880 --> 00:04:23.320
Good. So you're graduating.

00:04:23.780 --> 00:04:25.400
Yes. Thank you.

00:04:25.720 --> 00:04:27.490
Any luck with your job hunt?

00:04:27.650 --> 00:04:28.680
No, not yet.

00:04:29.020 --> 00:04:30.490
I was hoping that maybe
I'll find an opening

00:04:30.570 --> 00:04:31.650
at a private preschool.

00:04:31.800 --> 00:04:36.700
I see. I can recommend
you to a few places.

00:04:36.960 --> 00:04:37.510
You will?!

00:04:45.450 --> 00:04:47.610
There aren't too many places
with job openings,

00:04:47.680 --> 00:04:49.570
so don't get your
hopes up too high.

00:04:49.840 --> 00:04:50.390
Yes.

00:04:51.920 --> 00:04:54.200
I'll call them later,

00:04:54.380 --> 00:04:56.050
so why don't you go
to this place tomorrow?

00:04:56.220 --> 00:04:57.920
Here's the address
and phone number.

00:04:59.200 --> 00:05:00.130
Thank you very much.

00:05:02.060 --> 00:05:03.450
Good luck.

00:05:03.590 --> 00:05:04.990
Yes. Good-bye.

00:05:13.530 --> 00:05:14.370
Let's see.

00:05:23.550 --> 00:05:25.450
Someone, help!

00:05:26.880 --> 00:05:28.250
How did it go?

00:05:29.190 --> 00:05:30.140
Luck was on my side.

00:05:32.150 --> 00:05:32.840
You passed?

00:05:33.890 --> 00:05:34.620
You passed?!

00:05:36.070 --> 00:05:38.760
Yeah? Great! Great!

00:05:56.780 --> 00:05:59.450
It's been a while,
but here I go.

00:06:10.890 --> 00:06:12.360
Where is she?

00:06:13.460 --> 00:06:16.060
What're you doing?
Everyone's waiting.

00:06:17.510 --> 00:06:21.330
So I'd like to propose
a toast to Godai's future!

00:06:21.530 --> 00:06:22.460
Cheers!

00:06:22.750 --> 00:06:23.960
Cheers!

00:06:24.880 --> 00:06:26.310
Congratulations, Chief!

00:06:26.470 --> 00:06:28.880
I'll give you the
best service ever!

00:06:29.210 --> 00:06:30.640
Your thoughts are enough.

00:06:31.420 --> 00:06:33.610
Are you sure there
was no phone call?

00:06:34.080 --> 00:06:35.450
I don't think so.

00:06:40.020 --> 00:06:43.260
He must have failed,
Just as we thought.

00:06:43.320 --> 00:06:45.380
I bet he's too
embarrassed to come home,

00:06:45.460 --> 00:06:47.760
or he would have
been home by now.

00:06:50.510 --> 00:06:53.200
Drink. You must be
disappointed, too.

00:06:54.570 --> 00:06:55.200
I'm home!

00:07:03.250 --> 00:07:04.110
He's drunk.

00:07:05.690 --> 00:07:06.310
Um..

00:07:06.490 --> 00:07:08.820
Stop! Say no more!

00:07:08.880 --> 00:07:11.470
You just had to drink,
didn't you?

00:07:11.720 --> 00:07:13.420
It's brave of you
to come home.

00:07:13.560 --> 00:07:15.990
There's always next year.

00:07:16.130 --> 00:07:17.560
What are you all saying?

00:07:18.220 --> 00:07:18.840
Kyoko!

00:07:18.930 --> 00:07:19.570
Y-Yes?

00:07:20.460 --> 00:07:21.720
I'm happy to say.

00:07:25.240 --> 00:07:26.860
You didn't fail!

00:07:26.970 --> 00:07:27.500
No.

00:07:31.700 --> 00:07:34.260
Everyone, let's toast
to Godai's miracle!

00:07:34.450 --> 00:07:35.610
Cheers!

00:07:37.950 --> 00:07:41.030
CONGRATULATIONS, GODAI!
Good thing we made
this one, too, just in case.

00:07:41.120 --> 00:07:43.110
Now all you need is a job.

00:07:43.360 --> 00:07:44.950
That's the problem.

00:07:45.580 --> 00:07:47.010
You still have the preschool
teacher certification exam.

00:07:47.090 --> 00:07:48.860
We'll do a consolation party
next time.

00:07:49.000 --> 00:07:50.080
There's no need for that!

00:07:51.260 --> 00:07:54.200
I have an interview
at a preschool tomorrow.

00:07:54.740 --> 00:07:55.630
Interview?

00:07:56.010 --> 00:07:57.960
Shinomi Preschool's principal
recommended me

00:07:58.030 --> 00:07:59.060
to another preschool.

00:07:59.940 --> 00:08:02.300
As for the preschool teacher
certification exam..

00:08:03.110 --> 00:08:04.570
I plan to pass it
the first time!

00:08:04.900 --> 00:08:06.500
My, you're awfully confident.

00:08:06.880 --> 00:08:10.390
Godai, recommendations never
worked out for you in the past.

00:08:11.210 --> 00:08:13.140
The real world is
not that easy.

00:08:13.280 --> 00:08:15.690
Your worries are not over.

00:08:17.190 --> 00:08:18.400
I'm not really.

00:08:18.490 --> 00:08:19.920
Not really what?

00:08:27.390 --> 00:08:30.080
You two made up, right?

00:08:31.140 --> 00:08:33.620
This is so irritating!

00:08:33.830 --> 00:08:35.320
You make up, you fight.

00:08:35.410 --> 00:08:37.230
You two aren't teenagers,
you know.

00:08:37.310 --> 00:08:39.090
What? Don't give me that look.

00:08:40.320 --> 00:08:43.410
I know I caused trouble with
that love hotel incident, but.

00:08:43.790 --> 00:08:44.710
The root of the problem

00:08:44.790 --> 00:08:47.570
is that you two are
just too wishy-washy!

00:08:47.690 --> 00:08:49.020
Hurry up and
hook up already.

00:08:50.190 --> 00:08:52.420
It's not the first time
you've been in love.

00:08:52.900 --> 00:08:56.800
Or what? You can't
forget your husband?

00:08:57.360 --> 00:08:58.250
Akemi!

00:08:58.570 --> 00:09:00.110
It's okay, Godai.

00:09:02.070 --> 00:09:05.660
It's true that I can't
forget Soichiro.

00:09:08.500 --> 00:09:09.460
But I...

00:09:11.700 --> 00:09:12.750
It doesn't mean.

00:09:18.790 --> 00:09:22.110
The gist is,
you're in love with Godai.

00:09:28.530 --> 00:09:30.190
Stonewalling again?

00:09:30.570 --> 00:09:32.990
That's why widows
are so troublesome.

00:09:33.300 --> 00:09:36.030
Why hold yourself back
for a dead man?

00:09:37.070 --> 00:09:37.790
I...

00:09:45.240 --> 00:09:46.700
K-Kyoko!

00:09:49.210 --> 00:09:50.310
She ran away again.

00:09:51.080 --> 00:09:53.020
That's because
you pick on her.

00:09:53.190 --> 00:09:55.550
Why can't she just
let out her feelings?!

00:09:56.690 --> 00:10:00.680
Besides, watching Godai.

00:10:01.990 --> 00:10:03.430
makes me feel
sorry for him.

00:10:09.090 --> 00:10:09.890
Kyoko!

00:10:14.070 --> 00:10:18.370
It's true that I can't
forget Soichiro.

00:10:59.160 --> 00:11:01.780
I wonder how Godai's doing?

00:11:02.560 --> 00:11:04.340
What are you talking about?

00:11:04.530 --> 00:11:07.610
He's at his interview
now, isn't he?

00:11:08.320 --> 00:11:08.970
Yes.

00:11:09.320 --> 00:11:12.950
What happened last night might
be affecting his interview.

00:11:15.230 --> 00:11:17.700
So you've been working
part-time at a cabaret?

00:11:17.910 --> 00:11:21.070
Yes. I take care of
the hostesses' children.

00:11:21.680 --> 00:11:23.940
You must be going through
some tough times.

00:11:24.200 --> 00:11:25.960
It's not so bad.

00:11:26.340 --> 00:11:27.960
And have you graduated?

00:11:28.650 --> 00:11:32.810
Yes, I have. And about
the teacher certification.

00:11:33.520 --> 00:11:36.740
It's not a problem if you
try to get that as you work.

00:11:37.430 --> 00:11:40.520
I'll telephone you when
I make my decision.

00:11:40.590 --> 00:11:42.210
Thank you very much.

00:11:44.590 --> 00:11:45.980
Good-bye.

00:11:46.330 --> 00:11:46.850
Bye.

00:11:47.800 --> 00:11:49.220
Next person, please.

00:11:50.500 --> 00:11:51.960
Is the next person not here?

00:11:52.730 --> 00:11:56.220
Hirosuke! Don't run!
Be quiet.

00:11:57.550 --> 00:11:59.330
I'm sorry. That's my son.

00:11:59.450 --> 00:12:01.200
It's your turn
to be interviewed.

00:12:01.610 --> 00:12:02.730
Y-Yes.

00:12:03.450 --> 00:12:04.870
Me, too! Me, too!

00:12:05.690 --> 00:12:07.970
No. Dad has to
talk about work.

00:12:08.110 --> 00:12:10.230
Me, too! Me, too!
Me, too! Me, too!

00:12:10.390 --> 00:12:13.000
All right.
I'll play with you.

00:12:14.320 --> 00:12:16.250
Thank you so much.

00:12:16.670 --> 00:12:18.750
No sweat
We're in the same boat.

00:12:19.170 --> 00:12:20.930
Come on.
What shall we play?

00:12:21.440 --> 00:12:22.300
You be a horse.

00:12:22.810 --> 00:12:24.460
Horse? That's hard.

00:12:24.540 --> 00:12:25.460
You better be a good one.

00:12:27.680 --> 00:12:28.400
There!

00:12:28.700 --> 00:12:29.820
More! More!

00:12:38.290 --> 00:12:39.370
Thank you so much.

00:12:39.950 --> 00:12:41.180
No problem.

00:12:41.850 --> 00:12:43.820
Did you have fun, Hirosuke?

00:12:44.350 --> 00:12:48.160
Not bad. Mom's horse
feels a lot better.

00:12:48.430 --> 00:12:49.450
Hey! Hirosuke!

00:12:50.090 --> 00:12:51.030
I'm sorry.

00:12:51.590 --> 00:12:52.560
Please.

00:12:53.490 --> 00:12:55.400
When's Mommy coming back?

00:12:56.330 --> 00:12:57.320
When?

00:13:02.070 --> 00:13:04.310
Mommy's a stranger now.

00:13:04.550 --> 00:13:07.170
why?!

00:13:08.980 --> 00:13:11.970
Why?! No!
Let's go get her!

00:13:12.190 --> 00:13:13.110
Hirosuke!

00:13:17.320 --> 00:13:18.370
I'm sorry.

00:13:18.750 --> 00:13:19.340
Please.

00:13:20.300 --> 00:13:23.120
It's rather embarrassing.
She left us.

00:13:26.590 --> 00:13:28.210
About that interview..

00:13:28.670 --> 00:13:31.160
I think she's
going to hire you.

00:13:33.410 --> 00:13:36.830
The principal was
singing your praises.

00:13:43.190 --> 00:13:45.840
It must be tough,
being a single father.

00:13:50.580 --> 00:13:51.840
If I'm hired...

00:13:53.090 --> 00:13:57.290
If I get that job, I can propose
to her without hesitation.

00:13:58.220 --> 00:14:01.890
It's true that I can't
forget about Soichiro.

00:14:15.420 --> 00:14:17.320
K-Kyoko?

00:14:18.290 --> 00:14:20.150
How was your interview?

00:14:23.720 --> 00:14:25.660
I see. He said that.

00:14:26.750 --> 00:14:29.920
But I felt so bad for him.

00:14:42.500 --> 00:14:44.200
Maison Ikkoku.

00:14:46.680 --> 00:14:48.460
Yes, he's here.

00:14:49.480 --> 00:14:52.820
Godai, it's the principal
of Wakaba Preschool.

00:14:54.610 --> 00:14:56.200
I'm glad to
catch you at home.

00:14:56.290 --> 00:15:00.950
I wanted to let you
know as soon as possible.

00:15:01.900 --> 00:15:06.160
I was very impressed with the
way you treated that child.

00:15:06.270 --> 00:15:07.590
Thank you.

00:15:08.570 --> 00:15:12.660
I believe many other employers
would find you very qualified.

00:15:13.100 --> 00:15:15.540
And that's why I've decided
to offer the position

00:15:15.600 --> 00:15:17.540
to the other candidate.

00:15:18.370 --> 00:15:21.230
You know, it must be rough
being a single father.

00:15:21.610 --> 00:15:24.050
That's true.

00:15:24.340 --> 00:15:27.410
I-I understand. Good-bye.

00:15:30.480 --> 00:15:33.500
We're all on the same
wavelength, I guess.

00:15:34.060 --> 00:15:37.850
I'm really not in the position
to be pitying someone else,

00:15:38.860 --> 00:15:40.530
but I feel
a little relieved.

00:15:42.700 --> 00:15:44.290
There's no need
to feel rushed.

00:15:45.540 --> 00:15:48.120
I think it's more important

00:15:48.200 --> 00:15:52.440
that you find a job
you're comfortable with.

00:15:53.180 --> 00:15:54.070
Kyoko.

00:16:01.610 --> 00:16:03.100
I'm sorry about last night

00:16:04.660 --> 00:16:06.150
what I said about Soichiro.

00:16:07.620 --> 00:16:08.390
Please.

00:16:10.300 --> 00:16:13.420
although I'd be lying if
I said it didn't bother me.

00:16:18.500 --> 00:16:19.090
But.

00:16:22.370 --> 00:16:29.460
I don't think I'll ever be
able to erase Soichiro from me.

00:16:31.980 --> 00:16:34.820
After all, he really existed.

00:16:35.560 --> 00:16:40.480
I loved Soichiro more than
anyone else in the world.

00:16:44.120 --> 00:16:48.980
Soichiro was my world, and
he was the only one I needed.

00:16:49.410 --> 00:16:52.330
He filled my heart with joy.

00:16:55.470 --> 00:16:57.670
Soichiro!

00:17:03.890 --> 00:17:07.840
See those interesting strata
on that cliff, Kyoko?

00:17:08.450 --> 00:17:09.620
Those are...

00:17:15.960 --> 00:17:17.050
I was so happy.

00:17:22.230 --> 00:17:26.220
I can't give you the
same kind of happiness,

00:17:28.080 --> 00:17:33.500
but I'll do all I can to
make you happy

00:17:36.310 --> 00:17:38.610
in my own way.

00:17:44.250 --> 00:17:46.190
That's all I can do.

00:17:52.760 --> 00:17:56.490
I'm not seeking what I had.

00:17:57.460 --> 00:18:00.250
You're not
Soichiro's substitute.

00:18:13.860 --> 00:18:15.080
Otonashi speaking.

00:18:15.750 --> 00:18:16.620
Manager?

00:18:17.930 --> 00:18:18.580
Akemi?

00:18:19.160 --> 00:18:22.850
Come over! We're continuing
last night's party

00:18:22.930 --> 00:18:24.510
here at Chachamaru.

00:18:25.220 --> 00:18:26.120
Can you hear?

00:18:29.500 --> 00:18:30.940
I sure can.

00:18:31.610 --> 00:18:33.160
Then we'll be waiting.

00:18:34.910 --> 00:18:36.700
By the way.

00:18:38.080 --> 00:18:39.230
Sorry about last night.

00:18:40.120 --> 00:18:41.410
No, me too.

00:18:41.620 --> 00:18:43.880
Don't be. Bye!

00:18:49.450 --> 00:18:50.580
Was that Akemi?

00:18:51.160 --> 00:18:53.680
They're continuing
last night's party.

00:19:05.200 --> 00:19:06.060
Snow.

00:19:06.340 --> 00:19:08.560
It's turned into snow.

00:19:23.690 --> 00:19:24.540
Soichiro!

00:19:27.200 --> 00:19:28.710
I meant the dog.

00:19:29.960 --> 00:19:32.220
I haven't fed him dinner yet.

00:19:47.470 --> 00:19:53.060
It's silly of you to panic
when you hear my dog's name.

00:19:54.210 --> 00:19:55.540
You're right.

00:19:57.050 --> 00:20:02.360
But I can't help
feeling insecure

00:20:04.020 --> 00:20:07.090
when I think of
you and Soichiro.

00:20:10.260 --> 00:20:11.720
I'm always insecure.

00:20:24.810 --> 00:20:26.650
I don't know what
to do anymore.

00:20:42.730 --> 00:20:44.220
I'm sorry.

00:20:53.120 --> 00:20:55.540
Please. Think only of me.

00:21:44.100 --> 00:21:45.860
She's in a mighty good mood.

00:21:46.560 --> 00:21:48.990
You think so, too,
Mrs. Ichinose?

00:21:49.110 --> 00:21:51.340
A little too chipper.

00:21:51.640 --> 00:21:53.990
Maybe something happened
between her and Godai.

00:21:54.080 --> 00:21:55.370
Who knows?

00:21:56.240 --> 00:21:58.230
So where's Godai?

00:21:58.800 --> 00:22:00.100
He went to the hospital.

00:22:00.470 --> 00:22:02.640
Hospital? Something wrong?

00:22:03.650 --> 00:22:05.800
He went to see someone.

00:22:07.920 --> 00:22:11.710
A full-time job?!
You mean.

00:22:11.950 --> 00:22:15.540
I threw out my back.
I'm getting old.

00:22:16.430 --> 00:22:21.090
I was the only man there.
I beg of you... Please?

00:22:22.060 --> 00:22:24.360
Yes! Thank you very much!

00:22:25.340 --> 00:22:27.330
I got a job!!

00:22:30.380 --> 00:22:31.900
Congratulations!

00:22:32.510 --> 00:22:34.530
Sounds like he got a job!

00:22:35.620 --> 00:22:37.800
We still have these
leftover from the other night.

00:22:38.190 --> 00:22:40.850
I'm so happy for you!

00:22:42.160 --> 00:22:45.240
Thank you very much. Really.

00:22:49.930 --> 00:22:51.310
Kyoko?

00:22:51.630 --> 00:22:52.310
Yes?

00:22:58.200 --> 00:22:59.460
w-will you...

00:23:02.500 --> 00:23:04.340
Congratulations, Godai!

00:23:05.350 --> 00:23:09.110
I'm sorry. I couldn't
hear what you-

00:23:10.120 --> 00:23:12.040
He's gone.

00:23:17.090 --> 00:23:17.850
Oh, no!

00:23:24.520 --> 00:23:25.420
Kyoko.

00:23:28.560 --> 00:23:31.750
Will you please marry me?

00:23:37.650 --> 00:23:40.910
Congratulations, Godai.

00:23:49.930 --> 00:23:52.040
I wonder if Godai proposed?

00:23:52.130 --> 00:23:53.220
Not yet.

00:23:53.290 --> 00:23:54.920
He was rehearsing again
last night.

00:23:55.090 --> 00:23:58.220
But I heard the manager's father
is dead set against it

00:23:58.290 --> 00:24:00.340
I heard he went to the cabaret!

00:24:00.500 --> 00:24:03.850
Next: Way to Go!
Godai's Do-or-Die Proposal!!

00:24:04.240 --> 00:24:06.670
Kyoko, please marry me.
